## OpenTide detection repository

This repository uses [OpenTide](https://pypi.org/project/opentide/) for detection-as-code.

### Commands

```bash
opentide validate
opentide generate
opentide deploy --platform sentinel --dry-run
```

### Layout

- Threat vectors: `Objects/Threat Vectors/`
- Objectives: `Objects/Detection Objectives/`
- Rules: `Objects/Detection Rules/`

### Agent skills

Project skills live under `.claude/skills/`. Start with `opentide-detection-ops` for validate/generate/deploy guidance.

Run `opentide setup mcp` to connect Claude Code to `opentide-mcp`.
